WEBVTT

00:13:27.802 --> 00:13:30.576
Extremely effective.

00:13:30.987 --> 00:13:33.489
Somebody said the word
"revolution" is a bad word.

00:13:33.513 --> 00:13:35.654
I suppose it is,
so I won't say "revolution,"

00:13:35.678 --> 00:13:41.180
but it certainly evolved very, very deeply
our understanding of the proton,

00:13:41.204 --> 00:13:43.000
and of particles beyond that.

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:45.988
Well, I had some more
that I was going to tell you

00:13:46.012 --> 00:13:47.669
about my connection with Feynman,

00:13:47.693 --> 00:13:48.867
what he was like,

00:13:48.891 --> 00:13:51.195
but I see I have exactly half a minute.

00:13:51.219 --> 00:13:55.146
So I think I'll just finish up by saying:

00:13:55.170 --> 00:13:57.966
I actually don't think
Feynman would have liked this event.

00:13:57.990 --> 00:14:02.279
I think he would have said,
"I don't need this."